---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: game. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-game">
  <div class="atp20-game-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 368" role="img" aria-label="A comparison of board games and a stock market on four rows: rules, practice, reward, and opponent. Board games have written rules, cheap self-play, a clear result and a fixed opponent. The market has none of the four.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Why a board-game search does not move over unchanged</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao cách tìm kiếm của cờ không chuyển sang thị trường nguyên xi</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="62" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Chess, shogi, Go (AlphaZero, MuZero)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cờ vua, shogi, cờ vây (AlphaZero, MuZero)</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="62" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>A stock market</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một thị trường chứng khoán</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="80" width="872" height="62" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="doc" x={36} y={111} size={22} />
<text x="62" y="116" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Rules</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luật</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="106"><tspan data-lang-en>Written down. AlphaZero is given them;</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Viết sẵn. AlphaZero được cho luật;</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="126"><tspan data-lang-en>MuZero learns the dynamics itself.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>MuZero tự học cách ván cờ vận hành.</tspan></text>
<rect x="530" y="84" width="352" height="54" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="540" y="106"><tspan data-lang-en>Nobody has them. The other side is made</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không ai có luật. Phía bên kia là các</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="126"><tspan data-lang-en>of traders, and they change.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trader, và họ thay đổi.</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="150" width="872" height="62" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="retry" x={36} y={181} size={22} />
<text x="62" y="186" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Practice</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luyện tập</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="176"><tspan data-lang-en>Cheap: play millions of games against</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rẻ: tự chơi hàng triệu ván với chính</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="196"><tspan data-lang-en>itself from the same start.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mình từ cùng một thế cờ.</tspan></text>
<rect x="530" y="154" width="352" height="54" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="540" y="176"><tspan data-lang-en>One history. Your own orders move the</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ một lịch sử. Lệnh của bạn làm giá</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="196"><tspan data-lang-en>price, and no day restarts from the same state.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dịch, và không ngày nào bắt đầu từ cùng trạng thái.</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="220" width="872" height="62" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="scale" x={36} y={251} size={22} />
<text x="62" y="256" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Reward</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần thưởng</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="246"><tspan data-lang-en>Win, draw or loss, clear at the end</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thắng, hoà hoặc thua, rõ ràng khi</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="266"><tspan data-lang-en>of every game.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kết thúc mỗi ván.</tspan></text>
<rect x="530" y="224" width="352" height="54" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="540" y="246"><tspan data-lang-en>Return plus luck. Three years leave a Sharpe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi suất cộng may rủi. Ba năm dữ liệu để Sharpe</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="266"><tspan data-lang-en>uncertain by about 0.58 either way.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lệch khoảng 0,58 mỗi phía.</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="290" width="872" height="62" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="users" x={36} y={321} size={22} />
<text x="62" y="326" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Opponent</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đối thủ</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="316"><tspan data-lang-en>Fixed rules, the same board, a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luật cố định, cùng bàn cờ, cỡ</tspan></text>
<text x="190" y="336"><tspan data-lang-en>known size.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã biết.</tspan></text>
<rect x="530" y="294" width="352" height="54" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="540" y="316"><tspan data-lang-en>Adapts once a pattern pays, so the</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thích nghi khi pattern có lãi, nên</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="336"><tspan data-lang-en>pattern decays (post 2).</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pattern phân huỷ (bài 2).</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The tree-search machinery transfers; the assumptions around it do not. Board-game sources: the AlphaZero and MuZero abstracts.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phần máy móc của tree search dùng lại được; các giả định xung quanh nó thì không. Nguồn phần cờ: tóm tắt bài AlphaZero và MuZero.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-game { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-game-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-game svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-game text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-game .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-game .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-game .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-game .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-game .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-game .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-game .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-game .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-game .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-game .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-game .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-game .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-game .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-game .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-game .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-game .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-game .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-game .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-game .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-game .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-game figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>